center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 公正决斗.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/6d/i9n682wmdclvcpl7eypid3hlpgknou3.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%85%AC%E6%AD%A3%E5%86%B3%E6%96%97.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/6d/i9n682wmdclvcpl7eypid3hlpgknou3.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%85%AC%E6%AD%A3%E5%86%B3%E6%96%97.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/6d/i9n682wmdclvcpl7eypid3hlpgknou3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />以多打少的公正决斗\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>4\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>6\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>近战、对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-1\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（物理伤害）单体攻击，造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">180%</font>伤害。攻击前，驱散自身所有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]，驱散目标所有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">增益</span>]。攻击时，若自身[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"后备隐藏脂肪\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">后备隐藏脂肪</font></span></span>]层数为<font color=\"#ed7950\">10</font>层，则驱散所有层数并获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"免伤9\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">免伤9</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>回合；若[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"后备隐藏脂肪\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">后备隐藏脂肪</font></span></span>]不足<font color=\"#ed7950\">10</font>层，则重置本技能冷却时间。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-1 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/75/i12b13xi6nu3o31dwphrlipg2xm3bxm.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-1_0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/75/i12b13xi6nu3o31dwphrlipg2xm3bxm.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%B5%81%E6%98%9F%E9%98%9F\" title=\"角色图鉴库/流星队\"><img alt=\"头像 流星队.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/36/fyegbun96i4fodf5glhu8cus4z2ug7t.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">流星队</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><d